        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "I went to see Alexandrine for osteopathic services for my newborn baby. She evaluated my baby thoroughly and found she had a preference for the direction she turned her head. Alexandrine helped improve her mobility and gave me tips and tricks to adress the issue at home as well. She also gave some good advice to help avoid a flat head for baby. Alexandrine is very thorough and cares deeply about her clients. As a result of seeing her and taking her advice my baby has been developing very well and has improved her mobility. Would highly recommend if looking for an osteopath for your baby. Merci Alexandrine!",
        "time": 1740171890,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Meghan Davies",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112724007169428176863/reviews",
