        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqYtjVpY23GZaJQf-qhlnuyyEXIhHfTRMwHTh_W7B_B_vx3Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "We brought our newborn to see Alexandrine, she was amazing. She was very knowledgeable and calm. She helped a lot with our daughters torticolis and bone and muscle alignment. We saw improvements right from day 1. Would definitely recommend for any baby osteo needs",
        "time": 1741978309,
        "translated": false
